            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, yĩla asumbĩ onthe ma Aamoli, ala maĩ mũingo wa Yolotani kwelekela ũthũĩlonĩ wa syũa, na asumbĩ onthe ma Akanaani, ala maĩ ũtee wa ũkanga, meewie ũndũ Yeova wang’alĩthisye manzĩ ma Yolotani mbee wa ana ma Isilaeli, kũvika twainga, ngoo syoo syatweka, o na kũtyaĩ ũnyiau nthĩnĩ wamo ĩngĩ, kwondũ wa ana ma Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
