          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ andũ onthe ala maumie Misili maĩ aĩke; ĩndĩ andũ onthe ala masyaĩwe weũnĩ me nzĩanĩ makyuma Misili, matyamaĩkĩte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ ana ma Isilaeli mangangaa myaka mĩongo ĩna weũnĩ, kũvika mbaĩ yonthe, o asu andũ ma kaũ ala maumie Misili, mathela, nĩkwĩthĩwa matyaaĩthukĩĩsya wasya wa Yeova: o ala Yeova wamevĩtĩe atĩ ndakamanenga ũthei wa kwona nthĩ ĩla Yeova wamevĩtĩe aaĩthe moo ũmanenga, nthĩ yũsũĩte ĩia na ũkĩ wa nzũkĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
